# The ucas: statements emitted by the English frontend for 01_english_cli.ucas,
# re-run here in a FRESH process (no English translation step).
2^10
it(x: i8) = x^2
range it
it(x) = sin(x^2)
diff it x
it(x) = x^3 - 3*x
crit it
it(x: i8) = x*2 + 1
wrap it
it(a: u8, b: u8) = (a + b)/2
that(a: u8, b: u8) = (a + b)/2
equiv it that
it(x) = x^2*sin(x)
integrate it from 0 to pi
it(n: int in 0..100) = sum(i, 1, n, i^2)
closed it
it(x) = sin(2*x)
periodic it
identify y'' + y = 0
sqrt(16)
it(x) = sin(x)/x
limit it x -> 0
